      "id": "claim_dd3ce600e7634e1eb8fd1c2b0d36b870",
      "statement": "Talon refuses invoke before startup, rebuilds its graph when the approval snapshot changes, and leaves runtime resources open if background cancellation fails to avoid closing the checkpointer while a worker may still be writing.",
